  "bodyHash": "159019ed4fa6284e",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为部分模组添加了与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>TFC</strong></a>的配方兼容性。<br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>标签</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>所有金属薄板 -&gt; 板材标签</p>\n<p>胶水 -&gt; 史莱姆球标签</p>\n<p>去皮原木 -&gt; stripped_logs 标签</p>\n<p>黄麻纤维与稻草 -&gt; 可制浆标签</p>\n<p>石砖 -&gt; 砖块标签</p>\n<p>玻璃瓶 -&gt; 瓶子标签</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Create -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>安山合金</p>\n<p>机械皮带</p>\n<p>升降机</p>\n<p>流体储罐</p>\n<p>软管滑轮</p>\n<p>物品舱</p>\n<p>砂纸</p>\n<p>图纸桌</p>\n<p>图纸炮</p>\n<p>铁轨</p>\n<p>机械压模</p>\n<p>外壳</p>\n<p>去皮原木 -&gt; 木板（切割配方）</p>\n<p>木材与原木 -&gt; 去皮（切割配方）</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Enchanted: Witchcraft -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanted-witchcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>女巫烤炉</p>\n<p>烟道漏斗</p>\n<p>祭坛</p>\n<p>水壶</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Drones -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buddy-drones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>无人机组装控制器</p>\n<p>无人机组装台</p>\n<p>木质旋翼</p>\n<p>高级旋翼</p>\n<p>离子推进器</p>\n<p>钻头</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Immersive Aircraft -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>船体</p>\n<p>螺旋桨</p>\n<p>引擎</p>\n<p>锅炉</p>\n<p>岩浆膏</p>\n<p>旋转火炮</p>\n<p>望远镜&nbsp;</p>\n<p>炸弹舱</p>\n<p>强化螺旋桨</p>\n<p>生态引擎</p>\n<p>下界引擎</p>\n<p>钢制锅炉</p>\n<p>工业齿轮</p>\n<p>坚固管道</p>\n<p>帆</p>\n<p>船体加固</p>\n<p>电子陀螺仪</p>\n<p>改进型起落架&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Arbor Firma Craft -&gt;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arborfirmacraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">&nbsp;链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>去皮原木 -&gt; stripped_logs 标签</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>TFC More Items -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-more-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>植物纤维与竹纤维 -&gt; 可制浆标签</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Firma Life -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/firmalife\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">链接</span></a></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>菠萝纤维 -&gt; 可制浆标签</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>原版</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>石英</p>\n<p>下界岩</p>\n<p>铁粒</p>\n<p>金粒</p>\n<p>烈焰棒</p>\n<p>灵魂沙砾</p>\n<p>金块</p>\n<p>铁块</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
